## 🐳 Docker Images

This release is available as a Docker image:

```bash
# Latest version
docker pull guidedtraffic/s3-encryption-proxy:latest

# Specific version
docker pull guidedtraffic/s3-encryption-proxy:{{version}}
```

**Supported platforms:** linux/amd64

## 📥 Download Assets

Pre-built binaries and coverage reports are attached to this release:
- `s3-encryption-proxy-{{currentTag}}-linux-amd64` - Main proxy binary
- `s3ep-keygen-{{currentTag}}-linux-amd64` - Key generation utility
- `coverage-{{currentTag}}.out` - Coverage profile (Go format)
- `coverage-{{currentTag}}.txt` - Coverage report (human readable)

